      "_comment": "Aggregate state is DERIVED from children: done iff all children terminal AND at least one done; cancelled iff all children cancelled; in_progress iff any child past its initial state; else planned. A cancelled child does NOT block completion. Aggregates carry registered/amended events for audit but their state is a fold over children, not their own event stream."
